sentences.t:
Tum pudor incendit vires et conscia virtus,
praecipitemque Daren ardens agit aequore toto,
nunc dextra ingeminans ictus, nunc ille sinistra;

sentences.l:
Then shame fires his strength and conscious valour,
and headlong Dares blazing he drives over the whole plain,
now with right hand redoubling blows, now he with left;

But him faithful comrades, his knees weak dragging,
and tossing his head either way, and thick gore
from his mouth spitting out, and teeth mixed in the blood,
lead to the ships;
